1. Event-Driven (payment success, order placed, KYC approval)

 - Upstream service event publish karti hai, notification service event ko consume karti hai and alert trigger karti hai.
 - Scenario: User ne order place kiya. Order Service ko "Order Placed" notification trigger karni hai.

   a) Order Service order place karti hai  

   b) Order Service Kafka topic("business_events") me event publish karti hai

