   c) Notification Service ke 3 instances (pod) hain (HA ke liye) . Har instance ke andar @KafkaListener annotation wala method configured hai. Jis method par @KafkaListener annotation laga hota hai, 
      Spring Kafka uske liye internally Kafka Consumer object create aur manage karta hai. Ye consumer topic se events poll karke listener method ko pass karta hai. By default, har listener ke 
      liye ek consumer hota hai. Lekin concurrency configure karke ek pod ke andar multiple consumers create kar sakte hain.

      Example:

      @KafkaListener(topics = "business_events", groupId = "notification-service", concurrency = "2")
       public void consume(BusinessEvent event) {
         processNotification(event);
       }

      Is configuration mein har pod ke andar 2 Kafka Consumers create honge. Teeno pods mein total 3 × 2 = 6 Kafka Consumers** honge. Ye sabhi same Consumer Group (`notification-service`) 
      ka part honge aur collectively `business_events` topic ke partitions ko parallelly consume aur process karenge.
  
   
